      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1929987599726215189",
      "text": "[8:37PM] #PWD #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth vehicular movement from Bolade Junction inward to Ajayi Farm, and further to Ile-Zik.\nGood traffic conditions from Ile-Zik to Sule Junction.\nExpected movement on the stretch from Ile-Zik down to Iyana Dopemu.\nAppreciable traffic flow on the return journey.\n\nDespite rainfall throughout the territory, traffic is moving well, and there is no cause for concern. The roads are currently impediment-free, and officers are actively on ground to manage the traffic situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
