      "text": "[8:46PM] #Dopemu #TrafficUpdate \n\nAppreciable traffic flow from Cement to Iyana Ipaja, with a similarly smooth return journey from Goye Junction to Akiwojo Junction and down to Alaguntan Junction.\nGood movement from Agbotikuyo to Swipha, Akowonjo Roundabout, and Shasha Traffic Light.\nEfficient traffic conditions from Vulcanizer Bus Stop to Ogunlana Junction, Egbeda.\n\nOfficers are actively on ground to manage the traffic situation, and no impediments have been reported at this time.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
