      "text": "[8:54PM] #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth movement on CMS Bridge inward Offin Canal Market.\nGood traffic flow on Eko Bridge inward towards Ijora Olopa Intersection, although movement becomes slower beyond Ijora Olopa Intersection inward Coastain.\nSteady movement on Broad Street stretch, from Apongbon Underneath the Bridge to Offin Canal Market and Olowogbowo.\nGood movement on Eko Bridge inward towards Apongbon, connecting to CMS, Elegbeta Mini Stadium, Ebute-Ero Market, Leventist, and inner and outer Marina.\n\nCurrently, the roads are impediment-free, and Officers are actively managing the traffic situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
